WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.100
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.740
I wound up in the Digital World,

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.490
where I met Shoutmon and the other Digimon.

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Team ?       Team Kiriha                          Team Taiki</b>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
Mysterious                        Rival
Girl

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
<b>Enemy?
Ally?</b>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:12.660
Protagonist

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.410
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:12.660
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.590
We were targeted by 
Baalmon in the Sand Zone,

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:20.370
but he saved everyone 
from Lilithmon's attack

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.360
and was then knocked out 
by her deadly poison.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:27.110
He was actually one of the Warriors 
whose order was destroyed by Lilithmon.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:37.920
<b>The Dance of the Warrior, Beelzebumon!</b>

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:34.020
The Dance of the Warrior, Beelzebumon!

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.090
Those pierced by my poison claw

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:43.700
are doomed to certain death.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.760
N-Not here...

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:47.540
Baalmon!

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.730
Hey!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.730
Don't do anything crazy, Taiki Kudou!

00:00:53.730 --> 00:00:55.040
Let me go!

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:57.450
Baalmon is... Baalmon is...

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.410
Isn't he an enemy?!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.710
Release it.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:03.680
Pharaohmon?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:10.670
Use this Zone's Code Crown to 
release the power of the land.

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:12.220
Okay!

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:14.320
Code Crown, release!

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:30.800
Give me a break!

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:33.740
I told you, I can't stand heights!

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.840
That's...

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.090
It turned into a huge pyramid!

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.660
What is this?

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.640
What is going on?

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.830
This is the Pyramid of Revival.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:20.330
The legendary Warriors came here 
to receive the Goddess' care

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.620
and have their battle wounds healed.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:27.200
However, the Warriors lost their lives

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.680
during the Bagra Army invasion.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:31.770
The Goddess disappeared as well.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:35.860
The pyramid ceased to function until now,

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:40.260
but it has been restored by 
the power of the Code Crown.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:47.140
It may be possible to save Baalmon, 
the surviving Warrior, here.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.210
Really?!

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:52.270
Use the Xros Loader to download 
the power of the Goddess

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.450
into Baalmon's body.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:58.990
Only you, a Warrior of 
the Goddess, can do this!

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.630
All right.

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:04.430
Xros Loader, Download!

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.240
System activated.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.520
Initializing Digimon resurrection.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:25.400
This is all I can tell you.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.910
Our DigiXros wore off!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:42.330
We were all kicked out...

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.670
You're all out?

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:48.740
It appears we can't use the Xros 
Loader while it's downloading.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.280
The barrier is too strong to break through!

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.080
Oh... Really?!

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.580
Captain!

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:08.540
I'll call in a new captain for you.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.400
Mugendramon, come!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:15.430
What is that?

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.770
Isn't the download done yet, Taiki Kudou?!

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.250
Not yet!

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.210
It must be a huge amount of data...

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.530
They've broken through!

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.250
Taiki! We have to DigiXros!

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.890
No! We can't use the Xros Loader right now!

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:37.710
Sorry, guys.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.660
Hold them off until the 
download is finished!

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:42.160
What are you saying?!

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.830
Why should we help that jerk?!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.480
It's the General's request.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.100
Let's go!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:51.840
All right! I'll go along to give orders!

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:54.870
It beats being way up here!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:56.770
Let's go, everyone!

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:01.380
Guys!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.510
I'm counting on you!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.350
Guess I have no choice!

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:12.100
Defeat them before Lady 
Lilithmon wipes us out!

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.630
All right!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.250
Go!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.130
Old man?!

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.170
Heavy Speaker!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.770
Drill Buster!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:36.050
Hey! I'm the commander here!

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:38.370
They're ignoring me?

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.240
Oh, are you hungry?

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:46.140
Then eat that barrier.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.730
It's chomping up the barrier!

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:59.220
That was careless of Xros Heart.

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:01.810
They're sure to lose now.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.630
PawnChessmons!

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.890
We're outnumbered!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:11.380
Is this as far as we go without DigiXros?

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.140
At this rate, we're all dead!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:18.160
Why do we have to go through 
this just for that jerk?

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.500
I'm getting Taiki!

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:20.390
Shoutmon...

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:37.760
I see now...

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:38.710
Hey—

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.590
Stop!

00:06:40.980 --> 00:06:42.820
Enough.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:47.550
Don't use the power of the Goddess on me.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.120
I won't stop!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:54.760
I'm a failure who couldn't 
become a Warrior.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.130
I have no right to receive 
the care of the Goddess...

00:06:58.650 --> 00:07:00.620
I am not...

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:14.910
I lost everything.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:19.540
Ever since then, I've been so 
obsessed with taking revenge

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.250
on the Bagra Army...

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.490
that I strayed from my path.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:29.890
But you never gave up on your 
companions, to the very end.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.400
You are a true warrior.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.040
Just leave me.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:37.340
Go to your friends.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.910
I can't turn my back on you.

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.510
Because...

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.210
You saved me.

00:07:46.210 --> 00:07:48.120
You're my friend!

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:52.050
I'm sure all the others who are 
out there fighting feel the same.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.190
I won't give up,

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:56.150
so don't you give up, either!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.520
Shoutmon...

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.860
Uh... T-Tai-Taiki...

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:02.850
What's wrong?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.260
Not a thing!

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:07.990
Leave the bad guys to us!

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.270
I just came to tell you that!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.580
The barrier...

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:33.200
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.690
They may be made up of data,

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:40.570
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.630
Join us in our world of adventure

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:46.200
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:47.270
DigiXros!

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.410
The download is almost finished!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.080
So much power...

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.390
How do we fight an enemy like this?

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:46.580
You didn't forget about Shoutmon, did you?!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:50.110
I can take this one out by myself!

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:53.460
We're gonna save Baalmon!

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.890
Shoutmon...

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:57.200
That's the exact opposite 
of what he said before.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:02.670
Rowdy Rocker!

00:11:05.190 --> 00:11:06.580
Yeah!

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.650
What do you think of my strength, huh?

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:15.390
It wasn't supposed to end this way.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:16.590
Shoutmon!

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:19.950
Shoutmon! We'll back you up!

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.940
We'll back you up!

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.530
Advance, men!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:27.100
Let's go!

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:37.680
All this for me...

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:38.880
Guys...

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:42.530
Please... Just a little longer!

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:45.090
Hang in there just a little longer!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:54.990
I'm gonna get eaten! Don't eat me!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:11:59.580
What?

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.140
He's eating his allies...

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.380
My, there's just no helping you.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:13.680
Then...

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.320
I'll let you eat everything!

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:23.860
The Scorpiomon...

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.610
They're glowing...

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.760
Is he going to eat his own allies?

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:29.990
Huh?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.760
No! I'm gonna get eaten!

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.930
Yes, eat as much as you like!

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:48.510
You don't have to worry about me anymore.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.400
Fight, boy.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.690
Fight with the others.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.520
But, Baalmon...

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.690
Go!

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.890
Don't lose your companions like I did!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.900
Got that... Taiki?

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:06.560
Baalmon...

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.900
Don't worry about me.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:14.680
I'm feeling much better.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.560
Wait for me, Baalmon!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.350
I think I finally understand.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:35.660
Only seeking power doesn't 
make one a Warrior.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.700
Yes... I finally...

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:48.520
<i>Why won't the light of 
the Warrior glow in me,</i>

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:51.200
<i>even though I'm the strongest one here?</i>

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.850
<i>Because you are a Warrior 
with only strength.</i>

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.120
<i>Do you understand what that means?</i>

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.310
<i>Sir Angemon!</i>

00:14:01.310 --> 00:14:03.860
<i>Without strength, I can't defeat enemies!</i>

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.410
<i>You are far from the light.</i>

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:14.370
Yes... I think I finally understand.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:15.970
Sorry to keep you waiting, guys!

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:18.140
We've been waiting for you, Taiki!

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.300
Taiki's here?

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.370
Taiki!

00:14:20.300 --> 00:14:21.370
Master Taiki!

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.030
Strength exists for our companions.

00:14:24.030 --> 00:14:27.470
That bond itself is the 
light of the Warrior.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:31.350
I finally...

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.720
Everyone ready?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.720
Time to DigiXros!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.380
Shoutmon!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:42.130
Oh yeah!

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:43.420
Ballistamon!

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.060
Dorulumon!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.330
Knightmon!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:49.250
Knight!

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:50.450
PawnChessmons!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.700
Pawn!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:52.700
Starmons!

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.890
Yes!

00:14:53.890 --> 00:14:54.910
Yeah!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.840
DigiXros!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.480
DigiXros!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:03.300
Shoutmon X4K!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.120
Go, Shoutmon X4K!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:18.580
You think a mere DigiXros 
can defeat Mugendramon?

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.100
No matter how big you may grow,

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.960
Shoutmon X4K will crush you!

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:30.070
Burning Star Crusher!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.490
All right!

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:50.290
It can't be...

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:54.070
A DigiXros won't help you!

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:59.410
Taste the high spec power of HiMugendramon!

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.290
Shoutmon X4K!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.500
As a parting gift,

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.540
I'll destroy you with the 
strongest weapon of all...

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.880
With these Mugen Cannons.

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.770
Blow them into a million pieces!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.670
W-We're saved...

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:52.420
What?

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:53.540
Baalmon...

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.630
Baalmon!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.590
Baalmon!

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.420
Baalmon?

00:17:05.320 --> 00:17:08.060
Hang on! You've gotta hang on!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.840
Have I...

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.480
What?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.250
Have I...

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.390
become a Warrior of the Goddess?

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:27.090
You are a true Warrior of the Goddess now.

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:31.710
Sir Angemon... Everyone...

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:36.370
Baalmon!

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:41.140
Baalmon...

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:45.520
Baalmon!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:49.740
Baalmon, huh?

00:17:49.740 --> 00:17:52.600
I didn't realize he had 
that much strength left.

00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:55.910
This time I'll crush you all to dust!

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:57.790
Prepare yourselves!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:03.330
Wh-What?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.260
What's going on?!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.890
Baalmon's gun...

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.890
The light of the Warrior?

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:15.740
It can't be!

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.560
Light of the Warrior?

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:24.320
Just devour it along with them!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:30.000
I have died...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:33.280
But I am reborn as a true Warrior!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.800
Reincarnate, Beelzebumon!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.170
Beelzebumon!

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:43.900
A Warrior reborn from the land of death.

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:47.410
I will avenge my previous incarnation!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:52.780
A failure who couldn't even die 
has no right to shout!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.280
Death the Cannon!

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:11.800
Even after being reincarnated, 
is that all you've got?

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.600
This is all I need.

00:19:14.600 --> 00:19:15.780
The rest...

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:19.040
The rest is mine!

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.620
What?!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:38.720
We did it!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.200
Beelzebumon...

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:54.630
All right! Now peace will 
return to the Sand Zone!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.990
Guys!

00:19:57.910 --> 00:19:59.680
Hey, where's Beelzebumon?

00:20:00.850 --> 00:20:02.980
Huh? He's not here...

00:20:04.240 --> 00:20:06.480
Looks like he disappeared.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.540
Beelzebumon...

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.510
But, hey, you know him.

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:12.990
I'm sure we'll see him again soon.

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:17.170
Hey, Taiki, let me travel with you.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.160
Sure! Glad to have you, Revolmon!

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.000
Yeah!

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.470
I'm going to explode!

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:28.040
I'll send you to the worst Zone of all!

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:33.540
That wore me out. I'm so sleepy.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.930
You guys had a rough time.

00:20:35.930 --> 00:20:38.850
Rest in the Xros Loader for a while.

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.590
Good night!

00:20:43.920 --> 00:20:44.960
What?!

00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.140
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:58.140
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.670 --> 00:21:02.070
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.070
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.070
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Undead Type</b>

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:14.490
<b>Beast King Fallen Fist

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:14.500
What'd you think of that creepy tune?

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.590
Now we're in the Heaven Zone!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:19.820
